member.summary:
Ollama think override. Null derives from . Set values are normalized
(trimmed, lower-cased) and clamped to the accepted set ("low"/"medium"/"high"/"true"/"false");
an unrecognized value reverts to null. "true"/"false" are emitted as JSON booleans.

Returns the Bedrock Converse thinking-token budget (override if set, else derived from
). 0 means thinking is off; the Bedrock client omits the thinking field when
this is 0.
